        complexity: { best: 'a single filter replaces a multiplier and an integrator', avg: 'peak output SNR is 2E/N0 for any pulse shape of energy E', worst: 'output is only correct at t = T; sampling early or late loses SNR rapidly', note: 'Matched filtering maximises SNR at one instant only, which is why symbol synchronisation is inseparable from it.' },
