          feedback: { correct: 'Correct - the block length is the number of non-zero m-bit columns.', wrong: ['Correct - the block length is the number of non-zero m-bit columns.', 'Wrong - the all-zero column is excluded, so the length is one less.', 'Wrong - that is a single-parity-check code.', 'Wrong - this reverses the roles of the message and parity counts.'] },
