          feedback: { correct: 'Correct - divisibility is what makes the code closed under cyclic shifts.', wrong: ['Correct - divisibility is what makes the code closed under cyclic shifts.', 'Wrong - g(x) is often a product of several irreducible factors.', 'Wrong - the degree is n-k, not k.', 'Wrong - there is no such constraint on the coefficients.'] },
