          feedback: { correct: 'Correct - and the same shift register that encodes also computes it.', wrong: ['Correct - and the same shift register that encodes also computes it.', 'Wrong - dividing by the parity check polynomial gives no usable error information.', 'Wrong - multiplication is the encoding operation, not the test.', 'Wrong - the quotient discards exactly the information the syndrome needs.'] },
